      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.1+ISA.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 5:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kutor Yeso kïngölonchineghö chane körkeyïntin lö, “Kikatkat chi para sapipun, akuwach kuwit akïpal pïrïm nyo kïpïro sapipun kïlïkwï dipay* akïtek kïtar, atolapay kumönokyï ngori paren akïrutö kïwö kor nyo low. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kitïta osiswo pö ilö, kïyonta sekeyontenyi wölo mi pïchay kimönokyï par kïchengunö chane kareranto akwa cho kel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnam chane mötworintonay akïmuny akïyon kïwö kïtuw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyonta chichay pö par ngat mötworintenyi anka. Kïmuny pïchay mötworintonay möt akutö nyinte arasï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyonta ngat mötworinte anka, kïpar chane nyona akwighchï walaka cho chang lenyoni kimuny walaka, kïpar walaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitökïtïng chichay pö par chi akonga, weri nyo kichömöy nyoman. Ato mi löt, kiyonta weroni kïwö wölo mi chane, ompöwölo kilö, ‘Konyïtöy chane werïnyan nyo mötïny!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïmwochï kegh ngorichay pö paren lö, ‘Anyï wero chi pö par, apkana kepara atökemïla pare.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïnam akïpar akïwirchï paranay pö sapipun sany.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ayo Ighöy ne chichoni pö para sapipun? Ngwïnöy kïpöröy pïchoni akumönokyï paren pikö walaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22+PSA.118.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tum 118:22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ayo tomönye osomönökwa Kikirutchï lentöy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimököy kintöghoghi pipö Yaudi kïnömöy, ompöwölo kinkïtï lö kiparta körkeyïnoni chane, wölo kïpïstö akïpechï kegh, ompöwölo kiwagh tuyot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngala kwaghata suru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keyonta Parisaytin* walaka nko rïpanpa Erode walaka kïpa kïter wölo ngölontoy Yeso atökïnam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa wölo mi Yeso akïlenchï, “Konetin, kinkïtöcha lö, ichinyi chi pö man ametiminyinye wowïn pö chi, wölo inetenyi wölo lata machata Tororöt. Ayo wey chömunote kekwöghchï surï Kaisari anta ewo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkwöghchï nya anta ewo? Chepölkösnönengwa, kïlenchï chane, “Ompö ne tomökekwa oghotanïn? Ale köny nusïyon arosan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutö nyinte nusïyon, kïlö, “Pö ngo mötï nko kaynatanï?” Kïlenchï, “Pö pöytoghini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso, “Kïlenyona, otönö Kaisari tïkuchi, otö Tororöt chechi.” Kïtöngönchï chane nyoman nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kingalana Yeso paraku kitutunöt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 23:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïpkonchï nyinte Sadukaytin* cho kinetöy lö möminye kitutunötö ompö pich cho kimeghö, kïtep lö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.5+DEU.25.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 25:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Konetin, kikirwecha Musa lö, ‘Ato rapas chi akïpïstö korketö kïpuryö monïng, kïmïchini kïmïlöy werto ompö chichoni kokononi atökïyichï monïng chichay karapas.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimito werpö chi cho le mut nko odeny. Kïkensyö poretye, kïrapas möyïnye monïng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïl kokonay weri nyo kirïpöy kïrapas möyïnye monïng, kïlïkwï nyoni ngat ompö weri nyo pö sömök, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïmeghö werchay löwïr, le mut nko odeny kïpuryö monïng. Ato mi lötï kïrapas kokonay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pöyitu ngo kokononi ompö asispa kitutunöt? Akwanyï kip mïrön cho le mut nko odeny nyinte.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso, “Nka nyete wölini kyopotyekwa kïlïkwï tömonkïtö ompö Kikirut anta owesyo Tororöt? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo ato tutunö pich ngwen, kïwöghökisyot kïkörkeyitu malaykeni yïm, mökensïyicha chane amelö kipöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
